OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day with a few
OL,6,Fpassing showers but some spells of dry
OL,7,Fweather too. Moderate to fresh
OL,8,Fwesterly winds, occasionally strong
OL,9,Flater for Shetland.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA few light showers
OL,12,Fcontinuing in the evening alongside
OL,13,Fsome bright spells. These showers will
OL,14,Fbecome fewer through the rest of the
OL,15,Fnight. Moderate to fresh westerly
OL,16,Fwinds.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FA good deal of dry weather for
OL,19,Fmuch of the day but a few showers not
OL,20,Fto be ruled out. Best of the sunnier
OL,21,Fspells for Orkney.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
