OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA dry
OL,6,Fstart to Monday, but rain spreads
OL,7,Fnorth through the afternoon. Variable
OL,8,Fcloud amounts on Tuesday and Wednesday
OL,9,Fwith risk of showers.
